是结构性问题\", \"大规模无人机袭击与反无人机系统的实战战果需独立可核验细节\", \"小红书卡片级笔记补抓正文后是否改变现有结论(覆盖度缺口)\"]", "confidence": "medium", "supersedes_id": "wv-f47306bed0a5dbd4", "l1_ids": "[\"vp-9621ff7013ac\", \"vp-220f1a485a0b\", \"vp-6a2be86711f6\", \"vp-6e07ac1395f2\", \"vp-8cc589214d4d\", \"vp-0e9d9f060a22\", \"vp-b23e12f61377\"]", "source_ref_ids": "[\"src-04b976e998b7\", \"src-35b5b46bb66f\", \"src-41e03bc94a1d\", \"src-bdb72a69a328\", \"src-f86f0a02b7bb\", \"src-f26d039d177f\", \"src-57716a69cc86\", \"src-892677e1d3e1\", \"src-7e38f8f1c038\", \"src-8e691f9c959f\", \"src-5ced799861a4\", \"src-7434fb7500ab\", \"src-f89329c832ec\", \"src-fbe09c63a68a\", \"src-02c2a9805a91\", \"src-3fdc904ca23a\", \"src-3d42acbf1ed2\", \"src-b0f6d13376c6\", \"src-c3589354aae9\", \"src-d4fd7651d27d\", \"src-144db63a9d52\", \"src-326d91c55f3a\", \"src-2e92529ce93e\", \"src-2f3f0e2fad11\", \"src-29df650e0cd9\", \"src-190ce3895a76\", \"src-4e893ca84bd7\", \"src-4f82a42b4c15\", \"src-93f49315a162\", \"src-d1ce88d68a88\", \"src-90ce42415df6\", \"src-cf81acaeb25d\", \"src-bab169626f4f\", \"src-ad1ae14d84e0\", \"src-b908e3a355f3\", \"src-7bcb95db7c9e\", \"src-65378bb4a0ce\", \"src-88448fc33f10\", \"src-6a4598c1b723\", \"src-47d36b56c17f\", \"src-8d064e2faca7\", \"src-2df254c71e7d\", \"src-334cc1ca247f\", \"src-b73f9df2e14f\", \"src-03ffbc1d6338\", \"src-b69eba4f1b93\", \"src-457fc3be2e00\", \"src-92cca377a81c\", \"src-af2be8ea61e3\", \"src-3a6bff93c0af\", \"src-5e652caee352\", \"src-6b4af507be01\", \"src-804693cbd100\", \"src-43f57fedfa87\", \"src-c00527967443\", \"src-4a3e59ac95a9\", \"src-617e73ef09a7\", \"src-8082b83893a3\", \"src-888c6708efbf\", \"src-97f3ed24f93d\", \"src-a9a0c49cc904\", \"src-aebc47f9e8d7\", \"src-db6b00712709\", \"src-b47ffe323751\", \"src-bb9fb7c33856\", \"src-dbe9c95547e7\", \"src-e07623d8e4a3\", \"src-3d2bd074f154\", \"src-de1c80d16df0\", \"src-819b761634f4\", \"src-1197f691f12d\", \"src-203e750d5c6f\", \"src-054ba6dc7d00\", \"src-2ed4b44997f4\", \"src-3406f384a8d2\", \"src-229fef399f44\", \"s